  "answer_text": "IP Overlapping between sites can be enabled only if your account meets these requirements: you cannot use Static Range Translation; one IP range must be smaller and contained within the other; all sockets must be version 6.1 or higher; and each site must have a unique Native Range IP (no duplicates). The default Cato System Range is 10.254.254.0/24. To enable IP Overlapping, go to Resources > System Settings > IP Overlapping and choose Enable IP Overlapping between sites; note that this change is permanent and cannot be disabled via self-service.",
